    "intro_html":  "Seared cajun-dusted pork chops in a creamy sun-dried tomato and parmesan sauce, the same sauce that made marry me chicken famous. Each serving packs \u003cstrong\u003e{{protein}} grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e for about \u003cstrong\u003e${{cost_ps}}\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost). The name says pasta, but our grocery board priced the base and rice won, so rice it is. The sauce does not care.",
